cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use VIDEPE in your work, please cite it using the metadata below.'
type: software
title: 'VIDEPE: Visualization & Integration of Data for Epilepsy Presurgical Evaluation'
abstract: >-
  VIDEPE is an open-source web application for reviewing EEG and neuroimaging data
  (MRI, PET, SPECT) side by side, developed at the Epilepsy and Brain Networks Lab,
  University of Geneva. It runs entirely in the browser: no installation, and no
  data is uploaded.
